### chat-service REST Client examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:3002
### Requires: REST Client extension for VS Code

@base = http://localhost:3002
@token = {{$dotenv JWT_TOKEN}}
@roomId = room-uuid-here
@msgId = msg-uuid-here

### ─── Health ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{base}}/healthz

###

GET {{base}}/readyz

### ─── Rooms ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Xonalar ro'yxati (operator)
GET {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Xonalar ro'yxati — filter va pagination
GET {{base}}/rooms?status=active&type=support&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Yangi support xona yaratish (customer)
POST {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "support"
}

###

### 4. Yangi direct xona yaratish
POST {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "direct",
  "memberIds": ["other-user-uuid"],
  "title": "Direct suhbat"
}

###

### 5. Bitta xona
GET {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Xonani yangilash (operator only)
PATCH {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VIP mijoz xonasi",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### 7. Xonani yopish (operator only)
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Messages ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8. Xabarlar ro'yxati (cursor pagination)
GET {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Xabarlar — cursor bilan
GET {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages?limit=20&cursor=MjAyNS0wMS0wMVQwMDowMDowMC4wMDBa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. Yangi xabar yuborish
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "content": "Salom! Yordam kerak.",
  "clientMessageId": "client-uuid-001"
}

###

### 11. Idempotency — bir xil clientMessageId qayta xabar yaratmaydi
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "content": "Salom! Yordam kerak.",
  "clientMessageId": "client-uuid-001"
}

###

### 12. Reply xabar
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "content": "Albatta, yordam beraman!",
  "replyToId": "{{msgId}}"
}

###

### 13. Xabarni tahrirlash (5 daqiqa ichida, faqat sender)
PATCH {{base}}/messages/{{msgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Yangilangan matn"
}

###

### 14. Xabarni o'chirish (soft delete)
DELETE {{base}}/messages/{{msgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. O'qildi belgisi
POST {{base}}/messages/{{msgId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 16. "Yozyapti..." indikatori
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/typing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typing": true
}

### ─── Support / ACD ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 17. Mijoz support boshlaydi (ACD trigger)
POST {{base}}/support/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locale": "uz"
}

### ─── Search ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 18. Meilisearch orqali qidirish
GET {{base}}/search?q=salom&roomId={{roomId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 19. Sana oralig'i bilan qidirish
GET {{base}}/search?q=yordam&dateFrom=2025-01-01&dateTo=2025-12-31&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
